    "faq_where_order_q": "Where is my order?",
    "faq_where_order_a": "Open the order from the Orders tab to see live tracking on the map, your rider, and the estimated arrival time. If the rider has not moved for a while, tap \"Contact support\" below and we will check on it for you.",
    "faq_refund_q": "How do I request a refund?",
    "faq_refund_a": "Go to Orders, open the affected order, then choose \"Request a refund\". Pick the items and the reason, and add a photo if an item arrived damaged. Approved refunds return to your original payment method within 3–5 business days.",
    "faq_missing_q": "My order is missing items",
    "faq_missing_a": "We are sorry about that. Open the order, tap \"Get help with this order\", and report the missing items. Most missing-item reports are refunded automatically once confirmed with the store.",
    "faq_address_q": "How do I change my delivery address?",
    "faq_address_a": "You can edit your address before the rider picks up the order from the order screen. After pickup the address is locked — contact support and we will try to reach the rider on your behalf.",
    "faq_cancel_q": "How do I cancel an order?",
    "faq_cancel_a": "Orders can be cancelled for free while the store is still confirming them. Once the store starts preparing your food, a cancellation may be partially charged. Open the order to see if cancellation is still available.",
    "faq_payment_q": "Payment & coupon questions",
    "faq_payment_a": "Coupons are applied automatically at checkout when your cart meets the minimum. If a coupon did not apply, check its expiry and minimum spend. For double charges or failed payments, contact support with your order number and we will resolve it.",
    "faq_fees_q": "How do delivery fees work?",
    "faq_fees_a": "Delivery fees depend on the store distance and current demand. Stores marked \"Free delivery\" waive the fee when your order meets their minimum. The exact fee is always shown before you place the order.",
    "faq_contact_rider_q": "How do I contact the rider?",
    "faq_contact_rider_a": "After a rider is assigned, open the live-tracking screen and use the call or chat buttons on the rider bar. Please keep messages about the delivery only."
